  rule:'Absolute no-stopping (X): not even briefly. Restricted no-stopping (one stripe): you may stop for up to 3 minutes to load, unload, or let someone in or out — but not wait longer or leave the car. Arrows on the sign show whether the zone starts, ends or continues here.',
