  rule:'In Berlin\'s managed zones (most of the inner city) you pay at the machine or by app during the posted hours unless you hold a resident permit for that exact zone. Some plates say residents only — then visitors cannot park there at all. Check the hours: many zones are free at night or on Sundays.',
